cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it together with the open data-and-code
  deposit behind the method it implements, given as the preferred citation. The
  accompanying paper is in moderation at MetaArXiv and will be added here once it
  is public.
title: inspect-invariance
abstract: >-
  Measurement invariance and differential item functioning testing for
  multilingual LLM benchmarks, as an Inspect extension. Provides a linked
  multilingual evaluation task and the item-level analysis that tests whether
  the language versions of a benchmark measure the same thing.
type: software
authors:
